/// <param name="Icon">If options[&quot;icon&quot;] exists, then parse it using baseURL, and if that does not return failure, set notification&apos;s icon URL to the return value. (Otherwise notification&apos;s icon URL is not set.) <see href="https://notifications.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-notificationoptions-icon">Notifications API Standard: 3 API</see></param>
