/// <param name="Alpha">Whether the alpha component of the VideoFrame inputs SHOULD be kept or discarded prior to encoding. If alpha is equal to discard, alpha data is always discarded, regardless of a VideoFrame&apos;s format. <see href="https://w3c.github.io/webcodecs/#dom-videoencoderconfig-alpha">WebCodecs: 7.8 VideoEncoderConfig</see></param>
/// <param name="ScalabilityMode">scalabilityMode <see href="https://w3c.github.io/webcodecs/#dom-videoencoderconfig-scalabilitymode">WebCodecs: 7.8 VideoEncoderConfig</see></param>
/// <param name="BitrateMode">VideoEncoderConfig 字典中的 bitrateMode 成员，WebIDL 类型为 VideoEncoderBitrateMode。可省略。WebIDL 默认值：variable。 <see href="https://w3c.github.io/webcodecs/#dom-videoencoderconfig-bitratemode">WebCodecs: 7.8 VideoEncoderConfig</see></param>
/// <param name="LatencyMode">The expected frame rate in frames per second, if known. This value, along with the frame timestamp, SHOULD be used by the video encoder to calculate the optimal byte length for each encoded frame. Additionally, the value SHOULD be considered a target deadline for outputting encoding chunks when latencyMode is set to realtime. <see href="https://w3c.github.io/webcodecs/#dom-videoencoderconfig-latencymode">WebCodecs: 7.8 VideoEncoderConfig</see></param>
/// <param name="ContentHint">VideoEncoderConfig 字典中的 contentHint 成员，WebIDL 类型为 DOMString。可省略。 <see href="https://w3c.github.io/webcodecs/#dom-videoencoderconfig-contenthint">WebCodecs: 7.8 VideoEncoderConfig</see></param>
